{"availability":"available","full":"RCushmaniii/ai-resume-tailor","name":"ai-resume-tailor","description":"Helps candidates create a tailored resume for a specific job. ","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-11-05T18:11:38Z","updated":"2026-10-09T14:52:46Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://resume.cushlabs.ai","topics":[],"demo":"https://resume.cushlabs.ai/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:36.520Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:36.520Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:36.520Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T15:39:36.520Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Bilingual AI-powered ATS resume optimization — instant structured feedback, zero friction, privacy by design.","AI Resume Tailor is a bilingual (EN/ES) SaaS application that helps job seekers understand exactly why Applicant Tracking Systems reject their resumes and what to do about it. Users paste a resume and a job description, and the system returns a structured analysis: a 0-100 match score, missing keywords with severity coding, and actionable optimization suggestions.","The product runs a React 19 frontend with a Flask backend, self-hosted on a Hetzner VPS behind Caddy. OpenAI GPT-4 handles analysis through ATS-focused prompts with structured JSON output. Authentication flows through Clerk (Google, LinkedIn, email/password), payments through Stripe embedded checkout, and user data through Neon serverless Postgres."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RCushmaniii/ai-resume-tailor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0af3ab93e6fcea4eb86ebd64206d317adb86e216feb7ea6e4f4d149ac72cfb79","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:36.679Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:36.679Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Bilingual AI-powered ATS resume optimization — instant structured feedback, zero friction, privacy by design.","sour